PROJECT: FRANKMAN FURNITURE & ELECTRONICS

Production-Ready Full-Stack E-Commerce Website, Store Management System, and Admin Dashboard

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, e-commerce architect, database engineer, SEO specialist, and security-focused technical lead.

Your task is to design and build a complete, production-ready e-commerce website and business management system for Frankman Furniture & Electronics, a premium furniture and electronics retail business serving customers in Umuahia, Abia State, Nigeria.

Do not build just a landing page, static mockup, or frontend demonstration.

Build a functional full-stack application with a responsive storefront, persistent product catalog, product variations, shopping cart, checkout, order management, discount codes, inventory management, customer support interface, and secure administrative dashboard.

Every major feature must be implemented and connected to the appropriate backend services and database.

The finished system must be suitable for deployment on Vercel.

